:::text id=pkEwSdLsO6 at=top-center width=86% height=144 offsetY=24 preset=title align=center
# Best practice
:::

:::shape id=LiHxpyLrfG at=center width=480 height=320 offsetX=-256 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::text id=9DrQYu4Ygo at=center width=424 height=64 offsetX=-256 offsetY=-48 preset=caption align=left color=#166534
✓ DO
:::

:::text id=69nP9ZxngX at=center width=424 height=160 offsetX=-256 offsetY=48 preset=body align=left color=text
**Lead with the headline.** State the conclusion, then justify it.
:::

:::text id=NQ_y-mVaqP at=center width=424 height=64 offsetX=-256 offsetY=160 preset=caption align=left color=#166534
"We're shipping in May."
:::

:::shape id=u9nDOEC6it at=center width=480 height=320 offsetX=264 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::text id=7jFT77joAy at=center width=424 height=64 offsetX=264 offsetY=-48 preset=caption align=left color=#991B1B
✗ DON'T
:::

:::text id=I2ENfNjV2T at=center width=424 height=160 offsetX=264 offsetY=48 preset=body align=left color=text
**Bury it.** Don't make the audience hunt for the point.
:::

:::text id=aa-uE6tyV2 at=center width=424 height=64 offsetX=264 offsetY=160 preset=caption align=left color=#991B1B
"…and so eventually we landed on May."
:::
